s. But, you remember from our earlier remarks last year that we did expect the potential for the business to continue to improve its margins beyond the 30% that we have achieved and that…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/08/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q2-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2019-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Smith","x":"In the quarter, net sales were strong due to improved retention and price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/thomson-reuters-corporation-tri-q1-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2019-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bello","x":"Organic revenues grew 3%, which was partly attributable to a price increase related to the Refinitiv contract and also to good growth in the consumer solutions business, and EBITDA was up $8 million from the prior year period, primarily due to the Refinitiv revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/thomson-reuters-corporation-tri-q1-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bello","x":"This was driven by stronger sales, improved retention, as well as improved price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/thomson-reuters-corporation-tri-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bello","x":"Organic revenues grew 2%, which was mainly attributable to a price increase related to the Refinitiv contract.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/thomson-reuters-corporation-tri-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bello","x":"And lastly, Refinitiv achieved run-rate savings of $380 million as of the end of Q2 and expects to achieve over two-thirds of its total run-rate cost saving target by the end of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/thomson-reuters-corporation-tri-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Smith","x":"Now the value creation at Refinitiv since we began working with Blackstone has largely been driven by operational enhancements and cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/thomson-reuters-corporation-tri-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Smith","x":"So, within our first half performance, we are raising guidance for 2019 and '20 for both revenue growth and EBITDA margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/thomson-reuters-corporation-tri-q2-2019-earnings-c.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2019-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bello","x":"Organic revenues grew 3%, which was attributable to an annual price increase related to the Refinitiv contract, as well as growth in our agency business, and EBITDA was $5 million, as a benefit from currency, [Indecipherable] the impact of higher one-time costs and investments, which we expect to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bello","x":"Let me also remind you that Q4 should be the last quarter, during which our results will be negatively impacted by these [Indecipherable] restructuring costs related to the Refinitiv transaction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim Smith","x":"So to conclude, given our nine-month performance and our outlook for the balance of the year, we are reaffirming our guidance for 2019 and 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephane Bello","x":"Last quarter, we did increase our guidance for this year and for next year, very slightly.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Smith","x":"2019 was our first full year of operations since completing the Refinitiv transaction and restructuring Thomson Reuters in the customer-focused segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2019 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2020-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Smith","x":"…of all the achievements reflected on this slide and in particular, I'm pleased to report that our restructuring program, related to the separation from Refinitiv is near complete and we are looking forward to a clean year in 2020 with no further stranded or one-time costs related to the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/25/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2020-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"And in order to do so, we need to continue to invest in our customer-facing activities and continue to invest in our associates, particularly in areas like AI and software development.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"In order to preserve EBITDA and free cash flow, the company instituted a $100 million cost savings program in March targeting discretionary expenses, and I'm confident we'll achieve the $100 million target.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Eastwood","x":"As Steve mentioned, we have implemented a cost-reduction program while still preserving the flexibility to make the necessary investments in 2020 in order to ensure that we're well positioned for 2021 from an organic growth perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/thomson-reuters-corp-tri-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ryan Johnson","x":"But -- and have you paused price increases on contract renewals in any of the segments or offerings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"And Ryan, just as a reminder, our price increases occur when the contracts come up for renewal, so they happen throughout the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"This strong growth was primarily due to the cost savings measures we implemented in late March, in response to COVID-19 and to not having incurred stranded or one-time costs as was the case in the prior-year period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"Adjusted EBITDA for the Big 3 segments is 426 million, up 10% from the prior-year period, and the margin was up over 300 basis points, reflecting the cost savings programs implemented late in the first quarter related to COVID-19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2020-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"I am pleased to report that in June, Moody's affirmed our credit ratings and raised our outlook to stable to negative, citing the strength of our business and strong liquidity position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2020-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"Also, we are increasing our guidance for free cash flow for the full year from 1 billion to a range of 1 billion to 1.1 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2020-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"We're seeing similar price increases for total TR in 2020 that we experienced in 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"Strong revenue growth, the effective implementation of cost-saving measures we began at the end of the first quarter in response to COVID-19 and not having incurred onetime costs in Q3, as was the case in the prior-year period, all contributed to strong EBITDA growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"Strong revenue growth, the effective implementation of the cost savings measures we began at the end of the first quarter in response to COVID-19, and not having incurred onetime costs in Q3, as was the case in the prior-year period, all contributed to strong EBITDA growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2020-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"Given our year-to-date performance and outlook for the remainder of the year, we are increasing guidance for adjusted EBITDA margin and free cash flow for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"The combination of organic revenue growth for the Big 3 of 4%, coupled with the effective cost savings measures instituted in the first quarter and not having incurred onetime costs as occurred in 2019, contributed to strong EBITDA margin improvement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2020 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"However, the savings from the 100 million cost savings initiative we announced in the first quarter more than offset the dilution from COVID-19 impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"The strong EBITDA margin improvement of each of the three businesses was driven by higher revenue growth and a benefit from 2020 cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"And second, the savings from the cost savings initiatives in 2020 provided a benefit to the margin of 490 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tim Casey","x":"One of the levers you haven't talked about is pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"The strong EBITDA margin improvement for each of the three businesses was driven by higher revenue growth and a benefit from 2020 cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"Adjusted EBITDA was 35 million, 10 million more than prior-year period, driven by revenue growth, 2020 cost savings initiatives, and timing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"Given this strong first-half performance, we are raising our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"And as Steve outlined, today, we increased our full-year outlook for revenue growth, margin, and free cash flow, which is reflected on the slide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"The strong EBITDA growth for each of the three businesses was driven by higher revenue growth and a benefit from 2020 cost-savings initiatives, offset by incremental business-as-usual investments in advance of 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"Spend is forecast to step up related to cloud migration, streamlining internal systems, third-party contractors to support the Change Program and higher capital expenditures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2021-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"So given the progress we're making, we also reaffirmed our guidance for 2022 and 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2021-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"And as Steve outlined, today, we increased our full year outlook for total TR and Big 3 revenue growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2022-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"Spend is forecast to step up in 2022 related to cloud migration, streamlining internal systems and product engineering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/08/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2022-02-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"We see it reasonably the same in tax and accounting Professionals as they look to streamline and make more easy, the tax return preparation process and enable them to serve their customers with advisory-type services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/08/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2022-02-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"As Steve mentioned, we are increasing our guidance for both years since we expect to continue the positive trajectory for all key metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/08/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2021 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2022-02-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"This slide includes the guidance we provided in February 2021, enabling you to compare the changes and raised guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/08/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"As a reference point in 2021, our price increases, which vary by segment. tax and accounting was 5%; our corporate segment, 3%; in legal, 2.5%, yielding the weighted average there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"As we do implement some price increases for multiyear contracts, there'll certainly be a timing impact as to when that price is realized.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2022-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"Given all of those potential inflationary factors, Heather, we have considered those in our updated guidance for 2022 and when we reaffirmed our guidance for 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2022-05-03","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Douglas Arthur","x":"Steve, a lot of your information services peers have lowered guidance for 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/03/thomson-reuters-tri-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2022-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Hasker","x":"And so far, in 2022, they've seen pretty robust demand through their litigation practices through their restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2022-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Heather Balsky","x":"And as a follow-up, when you think of 2023, if there is a downturn, if you were to see some sort of sales impact on the margin side, you have the benefit of the cost cutting with Change Program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2022-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"The book of business that we have, Kevin, at June 30, coupled with the pipeline for the remainder of the year, were really the drivers for us increasing our guidance by the 50 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2022 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2022-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Toni Kaplan","x":"To raise the '22 organic growth guidance by 50 basis points, which is great to have a few quarters in a row of raising the guidance there, so congrats on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2025-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Eastwood","x":"We will invest over 200 million this year, calendar year 'twenty five, in AI, Gen AI, that will continue into, 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Steinerman","x":"Or was it layoffs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2025-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Eastwood","x":"As Steve outlined, we are reaffirming our 2025 outlook across all metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q3","e":"tri","d":"2025-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Eastwood","x":"We reiterate our outlook for 7.5% to 8% organic revenue growth driven by approximately 9.5% growth at the Big three segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/04/thomson-reuters-tri-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"One was in regards to how we monitor our GenAI investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"And we've made commitments to continue the 100 basis points of margin expansion in twenty six 'twenty seven and 'twenty eight, Hopefully, that gives you indicators that we're closely monitoring all of our GenAI and really all investments, period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"In aggregate, total company adjusted EBITDA was $777 million an 8% increase versus Q4 2024, reflecting a 110 basis point margin increase to 38.7% despite $19 million of severance expense related to our initiatives to reimagine how we work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Eastwood","x":"First, as I stated earlier, our Q4 results included approximately $19 million of severance as we take steps to drive automation, and productivity throughout the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2025 Q4","e":"tri","d":"2026-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Stephen Hasker","x":"As Mike will discuss in more detail, we are reaffirming our 2026 outlook for organic revenue growth of 7.5 to 8%, including approximately 9.5% for the Big Three.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2026 Q1","e":"tri","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Eastwood","x":"Our Q1 results included $12 million of severance expense related to our initiatives to reimagine how we work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/thomson-reuters-tri-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2026 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Keen Fai Tong","x":"As AI adoption increases, are you seeing that spend come primarily from new budget creation or from customers reallocating existing legal technology spend?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2026 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Keen Fai Tong","x":"In other words, to what extent is AI expanding wallet share versus just shifting spend within the legal ecosystem?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2026 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Bischoping","x":"Our Q2 results included $8 million of severance expense related to our initiatives to reimagine [ how we work ].","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2026 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Bischoping","x":"Included in this outlook is an expectation for $19 million of severance expense related to our initiatives to reimagine how we work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TRI 2026 Q2","e":"tri","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gary Bischoping","x":"As Steve outlined, we are raising our full year outlook for both total and organic revenue growth to the high end of the prior 7.5% to 8% ranges, incorporating the stronger first half performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/thomson-reuters-tri-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,8345,0,0,0,6979,895],[37,1,7229,0,0,0,5923,802],[38,1,8693,0,0,0,7565,628],[39,1,9511,0,0,0,8105,1053],[40,1,11123,0,0,0,9592,1051],[41,1,11340,0,0,0,9777,1138],[42,1,6970,0,0,0,5906,707],[43,1,7696,0,0,0,6293,851],[44,1,12142,0,0,0,10745,1051],[45,1,6142,0,0,0,4985,740],[46,1,7838,0,0,0,6510,991],[47,1,8176,0,0,0,6844,996],[48,1,11114,0,0,0,9771,997],[49,1,8391,0,0,0,7425,671],[50,1,8596,0,0,0,7337,915],[63,1,9554,0,0,0,7592,1502],[64,1,10272,0,0,0,8825,795],[65,1,6229,0,0,0,5037,839],